<title>DUBAI: Saudi Q4 inflation 1.2 percent vs Q4 1995.</title>
<headline>Saudi Q4 inflation 1.2 percent vs Q4 1995.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Saudi Arabia's cost of living index in 10 cities rose 1.2 percent in the fourth quarter of 1996 over the same quarter the previous year, Saudi Arabian Monetary Agency (SAMA) figures show.</p>
<p>Detailed data (pct changes on same qtr previous year)</p>
<p>		     Q4 1996	   Q3 1996	  Q4 1995</p>
<p>General index     +1.2	     +1.6		+4.7</p>
<p>All food	    +3.9	     +3.9		+0.5</p>
<p>Housing	     +0.3	     +0.5		+6.6</p>
<p>Indices</p>
<p>		     Q4 1996	   Q3 1996	  Q4 1995</p>
<p>General index    116.8		116.9	    115.4</p>
<p>All food	   120.9		120.5	    116.4</p>
<p>Housing	    124.0		124.3	    123.6</p>
<p>(Index base 1988=100)</p>
<p>-- Dubai newsroom +9714-626990</p>
</text>
